<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Colgate-Palmolive still a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Colgate-Palmolive still a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities Inc reiterated its buy rating on Colgate-Palmolive Co.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Heather Hay said Colgate shares are trading at a &quot;notable discount&quot; to both the market and the peer group.</p>
<p>-- She estimated the company can grow earnings per share at a consistent 13 percent to 14 percent rate and set price target at $93. She gave no time frame.</p>
</text>
